    "title": "Community responds to closure of St. Richard's Chapel - NewsBreak",
    "text": "13 hours ago We, members of the St. Richard’s Chapel community in Hickory Hill, are deeply saddened by the Diocese’s decision to close the church on Sunday, March 22. The reason provided for the closure was financial strain related to insurance costs. However, many in our community are struggling to understand why efforts to raise funds were not enough to sustain the chapel. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
